# Backend API base URL.
# - Local dev: leave unset — the Vite dev server proxies /api to http://localhost:5000.
# - Production (Netlify etc.): REQUIRED. Set to the deployed backend, e.g.
#   VITE_API_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com/api/v1
#   Without it the app calls the relative /api/v1 path, which returns the SPA's
#   index.html instead of JSON and every data flow breaks.
# VITE_API_URL=

